  "description": "Unofficial .NET client for Romania's ANAF RO e-Factura REST API: upload, status, download, message listing (incl. paging), XML validation and XML-to-PDF conversion, plus OAuth2 helpers and VAT-payer company lookup by CUI. Ships DI extensions and leaves token storage and HTTP resilience to the host. Not affiliated with or endorsed by ANAF.",
